# A root-owned .next left behind by a sudo build on 2026-09-01, moved aside so
# Next could recreate one it owns. Ignored because `/.next/` does not match it,
# and `git add apps/` otherwise sweeps 1.4G of build cache into a commit.
/apps/backend/.next.root-owned-*/
